==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Scarlet & Violet|Annihilape|109}} from the {{TCG|Scarlet & Violet}} expansion.
*'''Dynamite Punch''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Primal Clash|Nidoqueen|69}} from the {{TCG|Primal Clash}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

